
### `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Python
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Local secrets
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem

# Editors and OS
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Logs and temp
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.swp

# Python build output
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ROS 2
install/
log/

# COLMAP / generated data
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Generated point clouds
*.ply
*.pcd

# Robotics recordings
*.bag
*.db3
*.mcap
recording/

# Raw videos stay local. The final demo is on YouTube.
Media/*.mp4
Media/*.mov
Media/*.avi
Media/*.mkv